# Path & Package Imports

## Workspace Model

This is a **layer-first** monorepo. Import across projects via package names, not deep relative paths or old single-app aliases (`@/domains`, `@/core`, `@/secondary`).

Canonical packages (see `docs/architecture/workspace-topology.md`):

| Package | Scope |
|---------|-------|
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/shared-kernel-types` | Shared leaf (IDs, enums) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/contracts` | Shared Zod API schemas |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/utils` | Shared pure helpers |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/config` | Shared `ConfigLoader` (YAML + Zod) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/domain` | Backend domain + repository ports |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/application` | Backend use cases |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/platform` | Capability ports (Cache, Lock, UoW, Logger locator) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/logger` | Pino adapter (`packages/infrastructure/logger`; bootstrap only) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/postgres` | Postgres adapters (`packages/infrastructure/postgres`; later `redis`, `messaging`) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/nest-http` | Nest HTTP kit (ApiBuilder, pipe/filter, Swagger) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/composition` | NestJS DI wiring (context folders) |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/frontend-ui` | Design system |
| `@b2b-saas-starter-kit/frontend-core` | RTK store, auth/tenant/`can()` |

## Backend Examples

```typescript
import type { TenantId, UserId } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/shared-kernel-types'
import { Tenant } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/domain'
import type { TenantRepository } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/domain'
import { InviteMemberUseCase } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/application'
import type { UnitOfWork } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/platform'
```

## Frontend Examples

```typescript
import { InviteMemberInput } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/contracts'
import { Button } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/frontend-ui'
import { useCan, useActiveTenant } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/frontend-core'
```

## Frontend App-Local Aliases

Inside `apps/web` and `apps/admin`, FSD folders may use local aliases:

```json
{
  "paths": {
    "@/app/*": ["src/app/*"],
    "@/pages/*": ["src/pages/*"],
    "@/features/*": ["src/features/*"],
    "@/shared/*": ["src/shared/*"]
  }
}
```

## Forbidden

```typescript
// ❌ Old single-app aliases (do not reintroduce)
import { X } from '@/domains/game/…'
import { Y } from '@/core/…'
import { Z } from '@/secondary/…'

// ❌ Cross-layer deep relatives
import { Tenant } from '../../../domain/src/tenancy/tenant'

// ❌ Domain importing contracts
import { InviteMemberInput } from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/contracts'
```

Relative imports are fine **within the same package/feature**.
